- `tests/migrate-on-read.test.ts` pins all 5 legacy shapes; ran green (5 pass).
- Related `objection-pinning` + `release-contract` suites green (11 pass); `npx tsc --noEmit` clean; `npm run test:all` tail shows pass with EXIT:0.
- Findings box annotated shipped (v0.38.32), version 0.38.32, tag v0.38.32 present.
- No reject-class recursion (no spawn of test runner inside new tests).

<evidence>
Item: a read-path migration marks pre-v0.38.21 unflagged disapprovals superseded where a later verdict settled them, pinned by a behavioral test, full release gate green.
Output:
```
export function backfillSupersededObjections(history: AuditVerdict[]): number {
  let n = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < history.length; i++) {
    const trigger = history[i]!;
    if (!((trigger.disapproved && !trigger.error) || (trigger.approved && !trigger.error))) continue;
    const byRef = trigger.disapproved ? `disapproval:${trigger.at}` : `approval:${trigger.at}`;
    for (let j = 0; j < i; j++) {
      const older = history[j]!;
      if (older.disapproved && !older.superseded) {
        older.superseded = true;
        older.supersededBy = byRef;
        n++;
      }
    }
  }
  return n;
}
export function liveDisapproval(history: AuditVerdict[]): AuditVerdict | undefined {
  backfillSupersededObjections(history);
```
